				<p class="why-us-buyers__text">Отгрузка по предварительной оплате</p>
			</li>

			<li class="why-us-buyers__item">
				<div class="why-us-buyers__img">
					<svg class="why-us-buyers__icon">
						<use xlink:href="images/sprite.svg#icon-5"></use>
					</svg>
				</div>

				<p class="why-us-buyers__text">Услуги мерчандайзеров</p>
			</li>

			<li class="why-us-buyers__item">
				<div class="why-us-buyers__img">
					<svg class="why-us-buyers__icon">
						<use xlink:href="images/sprite.svg#icon-6"></use>
					</svg>
				</div>

				<p class="why-us-buyers__text">Гибкая система отсрочек оплаты</p>
			</li>

			<li class="why-us-buyers__item">
